<title>SWEDEN: Swedish car registrations up 26.1 pct yr/yr in Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish car registrations up 26.1 pct yr/yr in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish car registrations rose by 26.1 percent to 19,172 cars in February compared to the same month in 1996, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p>An increase of 34.6 percent was noted for lorries in February, up to 1,885 from 1,400 in February last year.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46 8 700-1017</p>
</text>
